    "slug": "ai-customer-analytics-cdp-asia-2026",
    "title": "AI Customer Analytics & Customer Data Platforms (CDP) for Asian Businesses: 2026 Guide",
    "excerpt": "The definitive guide to AI-powered customer analytics and Customer Data Platforms (CDPs) for Asian businesses. Compare Segment, mParticle, Amplitude, Mixpanel, RudderStack, Treasure Data, and regional platforms like Insider and Eko. Covering unified customer profiles, real-time personalisation, predictive analytics, and privacy compliance under PDPA, PIPA, PIPL, and DPDP Act. With market-specific stacks for Singapore, Hong Kong, Japan, South Korea, India, Indonesia, Thailand, Vietnam, Philippines, and Malaysia.",
