    "slug": "ai-customer-support-tools-small-business-asia",
    "title": "AI Customer Support Tools for Small Businesses in Asia (2026)",
    "excerpt": "Automate customer support with AI chatbots, ticket systems, and help desks. Compare Intercom Fin, Zendesk AI, Tidio, LiveChat, and more for Asian small businesses.",
    "date": "2026-05-18",
    "author": "Apifeny Team",
