    "excerpt": "Asian e-commerce sellers on Shopee, Lazada, and TikTok Shop are using AI product photography to create studio-quality images without a studio. We tested 10 tools for background removal, virtual models, batch editing, and Asian product aesthetics.",
    "date": "2026-05-26",
