    "title": "AI for HR in Asia (2026): From Compliance to Culture — Beyond Recruitment into the Full Employee Lifecycle",
    "excerpt": "AI in Asian HR has moved far beyond recruitment. From automated payroll compliance across 10+ Asian countries to predictive retention analytics and AI-powered wellbeing platforms, this guide covers 20+ tools transforming the full employee lifecycle for Asian companies of all sizes.",
