    "title": "AI Tools for Healthcare & Clinic Management in Asia (2026): From Scheduling to Patient Communication",
    "excerpt": "Running a clinic in Asia means juggling multi-language patient communications, complex regulatory compliance, and rising operational costs. Here are the AI tools transforming healthcare management across Singapore, Malaysia, Hong Kong, and Thailand in 2026.",
    "date": "2026-05-26",
