    "title": "AI for Insurance & Insurtech in Asia (2026): 40+ Tools Transforming Underwriting, Claims, Fraud Detection & Customer Service — Complete Industry Guide",
    "excerpt": "From ZhongAn issuing 20 billion policies with AI-powered underwriting to AIA Vitality’s wearable-based life insurance scoring across 18 markets and India’s Acko processing 95% of motor claims without human touch — Asia has become the global insurtech laboratory. This guide covers 40+ tools, 15+ country-level case studies, and a full implementation roadmap.",
