    "title": "Best AI Tools for Manufacturing in Asia (2026): Predictive Maintenance, Quality Control, Supply Chain & Smart Factory AI",
    "excerpt": "Asia's $7T manufacturing sector is undergoing an AI-driven revolution. This comprehensive guide covers the top predictive maintenance, quality control, supply chain, and digital twin tools powering the region's smart factories.",
    "date": "2026-05-31",
