    "excerpt": "The definitive guide to AI-powered marketing analytics and attribution for Asian businesses. Compare GA4, Adobe Analytics, Mixpanel, Amplitude, Triple Whale, Northbeam, Rockerbox, and regional platforms with market-specific stacks for Singapore, Hong Kong, Japan, South Korea, India, Indonesia, Thailand, Vietnam, Philippines, and Malaysia. Covering multi-touch attribution, predictive lead scoring, marketing mix modeling, LTV prediction, incrementality testing, and the unique challenges of fragmented customer journeys across super-apps and walled gardens.",
