    "excerpt": "The definitive guide to AI resume builders, job search platforms, and career tools optimized for Asian markets in 2026. Compare Enhanced CV, CakeResume, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Referena, and more across Singapore, Japan, Korea, Taiwan, and Southeast Asia.",
