    "excerpt": "Rank on Google, Baidu, and Naver with the best AI-powered SEO tools for Asian markets. Compare Semrush, Surfer SEO, SE Ranking, and more for multi-language SEO in 2026.",
    "date": "2026-05-18",
    "author": "Apifeny Team",
