    "excerpt": "Running a small business in SEA means juggling GrabFood orders, Shopee listings, multiple currencies, and 5+ languages. Here are 15 AI tools that actually work for Thai street food vendors, Filipino online sellers, Indonesian warung owners, and Vietnamese SMEs — with local pricing and real-world workflows.",
