    "title": "AI Website Builders for Small Business 2026 — Wix vs Squarespace vs Framer vs 10Web",
    "excerpt": "We tested 6 AI website builders for small businesses in Asia. Wix ADI vs Squarespace vs Framer vs 10Web vs Durable vs Hostinger — complete comparison with pricing, local payment support, and country-specific recommendations.",
