    "title": "How to Build an AI Workflow Automation Stack Under $50/Month for Asian Solopreneurs",
    "excerpt": "Build a complete AI workflow automation stack for under $50/month. Covers n8n, Make, Zapier alternatives, DeepSeek API, and email automation tools optim...",
    "date": "2026-05-15",
    "author": "Apifeny Team",
