    "excerpt": "Agentic AI — AI systems that plan, execute, and iterate autonomously — is reshaping enterprise workflows across Asia. This comprehensive guide covers the top platforms, cost comparisons, regional regulatory considerations, and a practical 12-week implementation roadmap for Asian enterprises.",
