    "excerpt": "With ~30 million population, 32.4 million mobile connections (109% penetration), and rapidly growing internet adoption (65-72%), Nepal is one of South Asia's most exciting emerging digital markets. Kathmandu's startup ecosystem counts 109+ startups on StartupBlink, the government's Digital Nepal Framework prioritizes AI, and the country is South Asia's #2 freelancer market. From AI-powered Everest trek planning and remittance fintech to tea garden management AI and Nepali language tools, here's your complete guide to AI tools for the Nepal market in 2026.",
