    "title": "Build Your First AI Agent in 2026: A Step-by-Step Guide for Asian Solopreneurs",
    "excerpt": "You don't need a CS degree to build an AI agent in 2026. This practical guide walks through choosing the right platform, designing workflows, and deploying your first automation agent — tested with Asian business tools, languages, and platforms.",
