    "slug": "cursor-vs-copilot-2026",
    "title": "Cursor vs Copilot 2026: Which AI Coding Assistant Wins for Your Stack?",
    "excerpt": "Cursor vs GitHub Copilot in 2026. Compare features, pricing, code quality, and Asian-language support to decide which AI coding assistant fits your workflow.",
    "date": "2026-05-22",
    "author": "Apifeny AI Team",
