    "excerpt": "The complete guide to DeepSeek R1 and V3 in 2026. Learn how to access DeepSeek from anywhere in Asia, use it for coding with Cursor and VS Code, generate research papers, create multilingual content, and save up to 90% on API costs vs OpenAI.",
